The files in this directory — the CruxCoach wordmark, logo, app launcher
icon source, and pre-rendered raster derivatives — are NOT covered by the
project's GPLv3 source-code license. They are kept in the repository for
build reproducibility and developer convenience, not as a grant of
redistribution rights.

App-launcher derivatives under
androidApp/src/main/res/mipmap-*/ic_launcher*.png are exported from this
master vector and are subject to the same terms.

USES PERMITTED WITHOUT PERMISSION

  - Building, signing, and installing CruxCoach APKs from this repository
    for personal or educational use.
  - Embedding the logo as an inline image when linking to the upstream
    project at https://codeberg.org/CruxCoach/CruxCoach, with a clear and
    unobscured link back.
  - Screenshots of the app for any non-commercial purpose.

USES THAT REQUIRE PERMISSION

  - Distributing modified APKs under the CruxCoach name and icon to a wide
    audience.
  - Use in a different product name, packaging, advertising, or commercial
    context.
  - Producing merchandise (stickers, prints, shirts) that bears the Marks.

See ../TRADEMARK.md in the repository root for the full policy and the
rationale behind these restrictions.
